{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会 in 名古屋～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7996341/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ngng～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その前に！\n前日 アンダーで撮影があって\n終わって皆で温泉行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7996341/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ～い(o^^o)\nめっちゃ久しぶり！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、まず、ツッコミいれさせて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな、タオルで隠しすぎ（笑）\nそんな巻かなくても！\nせいらりん、あみ\n君たち温水プールで泳ぎすぎ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてみんな風呂出るの\n早すぎ（；゜０゜）！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで入っちょったのが\nみさと陽菜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大分はほんと温泉多くて\n週1くらいで入るときもあったけん\n大分の人はタオルとかで隠さないよ！\n（多分・・・）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな\nタオルで隠していて\n可愛かった\\(//∇//)\\笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってゆう温泉の話しと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会！\n名古屋の方、\n遠くから来てくださった方\nみなさんありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7996341/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服も私服でみんな新鮮でした。\nみんな、可愛かった\\(//∇//)\\\nでもなんかフワフワ～\nニット系が多かった気がする。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなわたしもワンピース。\nフワフワん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもせっかくの私服で握手！やけん\n次はもうちょっと\n個性を出せたらいいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7996341/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさ・ろってぃー\n（写）せいたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、そんな個別握手会の感想！\nやっぱり緊張する！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれレーンがあって\nそれぞれの子とだけ、握手。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握とちょっと違って\n自分のためだけに来てくれるから\n来てくれるかなぁ\nって不安いっぱいありました。\nけどその分 来てくれたときは\n本当に本当に、嬉しさも大きいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安も みなさんと握手して\n話しよんうちに\nすっかり忘れていました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7996341/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の握手会も楽しみ\\(//∇//)\\！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪は 2部はいつものストレート\n4部は巻き巻き\n最後の5部はお団子"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7996341/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7996341/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初おだんご"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7996341/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選択肢になかったんやけど\n巻き巻きにしたときに\n巻いたら、なんとなく\nお団子にしてみたくなったんだよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーですか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7996341/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子は高校のとき\nよく学校にしていきよったなー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でも、ファンの方から\nお団子めっちゃいいやん！って\n言われて 嬉しかったです。照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーと撮った写真が\n他にあるので、また貼ります(^｡^)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7996341/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はレコーディングでした！\n明日は 収録のお仕事(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も一日頑張ろうっ！！\nでは、おやすみさみさ！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/27/7996341/0009.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}